Section: 2 Large Neural Network
Text: Our main motivation for unfolding is to obtain a single network with ensemble level performance which can be shrunk with the techniques in Sec. 3. Suppose we ensemble two single layer feed- forward neural nets as shown in Fig. 1. Nor- mally, ensembling is implemented by performing an isolated forward pass through the ﬁrst network (Fig. 1(a)), another isolated forward pass through the second network (Fig. 1(b)), and averaging the activities in the output layers of both networks.

